 "description": "Historical probability time-series for one Polymarket market. Returns array of {timestamp, price} where price is Yes-side probability in [0,1] (No-side is 1\u2212Yes). Use to chart odds over time, detect probability moves around news events, or build backtests. Intervals 1h | 6h | 1d | 1w | 1m | max \u2014 supports up to a month (1m) and full history (max). A young market may have less data than the requested window; the `coverage` field reports the actual span and whether it is the full available history (a data limit, not a tool limit).",
 "inputSchema": {
  "examples": [
   {
    "slug_or_id": "will-kristi-noem-win-the-2028-republican-presidential-nomination"
   },
   {
    "interval": "1h",
    "slug_or_id": "will-kristi-noem-win-the-2028-republican-presidential-nomination"
   }
  ],
  "properties": {
   "interval": {
    "description": "1h | 6h | 1d | 1w | 1m | max (default 1d). Higher fidelity for shorter windows.",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "slug_or_id": {
    "description": "Market slug or numeric id (same as polymarket_market)",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "slug_or_id"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
